    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_ColiseumAnnounce:SubEv_ColiseumAnnounce_003:a0f46970",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_ColiseumAnnounce",
        "key": "SubEv_ColiseumAnnounce_003",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_ColiseumAnnounce:SubEv_ColiseumAnnounce_003:a0f46970",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_ColiseumAnnounce:SubEv_ColiseumAnnounce_003:a0f46970",
        "jp_sha256": "289cc0129df9ae98d8f8e1f29985340e1f0c8955bfdb3e3b807c06910b1e3277",
        "official_en_sha256": "f94a0cce3ba33143f2f4562b7c9d90623464727a45cb00c0f05f455e5f8fbc62"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "　\r\n　\r\n　\r\n　\r\n―グランシェルト・コロシアム再開！　挑戦者求む！―\r\n\r\n王都グランシェルトにて、\r\nコロシアムの運営が再開されたようだ。\r\n\r\nこれは騎士国家であるグランシェルト王国が\r\n元々、騎士たちの武を問うために開催していたものだ。\r\n\r\n今は身分問わず参加が可能となり、人気となった催しである。\r\n\r\n主催者のグランシェルト王は\r\n「腕に覚えのある者の参加を心待ちにしている」\r\nとのこと。\r\n\r\nなお、報酬には伝説の宝具の一つ「大地のハンマー」も用意されているようだ。\r\n我こそは、という者はぜひ、挑戦してみてほしい。\r\n\r\n記者：フォクシー",
        "official_en": "　Grandshelt Colosseum Reopens Its Gates—Challengers Welcome\r\n\r\nThe Royal Capital is abuzz with excitement as the famed Grandshelt Colosseum officially reopened, inviting warriors from across the world to test their strength in the arena once more. \r\n\r\nOriginally established as a proving ground for the fabled Knights of Grandshelt, the Colosseum has evolved into one of the realm’s most popular forms of entertainment. Over the years, its gates have opened to warriors of all backgrounds, transforming it into a celebrated venue for competitive combat. “All who are confident in their martial prowess are welcome,” declared the king of Grandshelt during the reopening ceremony, signaling a new era of spectacle.\r\n\r\nIn addition to glory and recognition, contenders will compete for a plethora of spectacular prizes—among them, the legendary Gaia Hammer.",
        "real_en": "Grandshelt Colosseum Reopens! Challengers Wanted!\n\nThe Colosseum in the royal capital of Grandshelt has reportedly reopened.\n\nThe Kingdom of Grandshelt, a nation of knights, originally held these contests to test its knights' prowess.\n\nToday anyone can enter, regardless of social standing, and the event has grown popular.\n\nThe king of Grandshelt, who organizes the event, says he looks forward to welcoming those confident in their skills.\n\nPrizes reportedly include the Earth Hammer, one of the legendary artifacts. Anyone who thinks they have what it takes is encouraged to compete.\n\nReporter: Foxie"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
