      "text": {
        "jp": "まだ一度も出場したことないんだよな。\r\n鍛えるにはもってこいだし、\r\n報酬も出るんだよな。",
        "official_en": "Maybe it’s finally time I signed up to fight. It’d be a perfect way to get some training in, and maybe even walk away with some prizes if I manage to win some fights.",
        "real_en": "I've never competed there before. It'd be great training, and there are rewards, too."
      },
